a number called kid is fork the process.
If kid is 0 then, Exit 7.
a number called nobody is kid minus kid.
a number called got is reap process nobody.
On error Print "reap process 0 is refused".
Print got.
Set nobody to 0 minus 1.
Set got to reap child nobody without waiting.
On error Print "reap child -1 is refused".
Set nobody to 4294967296 add kid.
Set got to reap process nobody.
On error Print "a pid wider than 32 bits is refused".
Set got to reap process kid.
If got is kid then, Print "reap process kid reaped the child".
Print "status {the reaped status}".
